QuiCare is a company leader in the development and management of  innovative projects, integrated solutions, and services to support chronic patients and their families.

QuiCare works with leading pharmaceutical companies
to design and deliver complex healthcare services, including Patient Support Programs, Digital Health solutions and operational models
supporting patient care and therapy adherence.

We put our  heart, soul, and skills
 into making a difference for people. Working together to push the boundaries, we blend the best of our talents to unlock innovation.
Will you join us in our pioneering adventure?
As a Healthcare Project Manager
you will be responsible for the overall management of projects in digital health and communication with pharmaceutical companies, monitoring daily activities and KPIs to be achieved. You will be in charge of the following tasks:
Manage projects in its entirety: design and planning of activities, verification of progress, strict adherence to delivery deadlines;
Coordination of the work team, assign tasks and activities and ensure they are completed on schedule;
Interfacing with referents of the pharmaceutical companies;
Meet the timelines shared with the client for project releases;
Manage and coordinate suppliers for individual projects;
Draft procedures and documentation related to the projects;
Manage provider and service costs;
Prepare reports based on project KPIs, both for internal use and to share externally.

Requirements

Prior experience as Project Manager in companies and/or istitutions in the consulting, heatlthcare and/or digital industries;
Ability to prepare project documentation (reports and presentations);

University degree, preferably in Economics, Management, Engineering or related fields;

Fluent English
(minimum B2 level); Italian fluency is required;
Knowledge of Agile and Waterfall metodology;
RAL 30K-45K
Work on site

Benefits

A career in an ambitious, international and fast-growing consulting company;
Meritocratic, young and dynamic company;
Talented and collaborative colleagues;
Welfare benefits and performance bonus;
Paid time off on your birthday;
Health insurance;
Unlimited coffee!

